%% ===== 时序图 1：测试连接 =====
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant F as ConnectionForm (前端)
    participant C as ConnectionsRoute
    participant CS as ConnectionService
    participant DB as DbService
    participant CR as CryptoService

    U->>F: 填写连接信息，点「测试连接」
    F->>C: POST /api/connections/test (ConnectionInput 明文)
    C->>CS: test(input)
    CS->>CR: encrypt(password) 仅用于本次测试(不入文件)
    CS->>DB: testConnection(input)
    DB->>DB: 建连 + SELECT 1 计时
    alt 成功
        DB-->>CS: {ok:true, latencyMs}
    else 失败
        DB-->>CS: {ok:false, message}
    end
    CS-->>C: ConnectionTestRes
    C-->>F: {code:0, data:ConnectionTestRes}
    F-->>U: 显示成功/失败原因

%% ===== 时序图 2：执行 SQL =====
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant E as SqlEditor (前端)
    participant Q as QueryRoute
    participant CS as ConnectionService
    participant CR as CryptoService
    participant DB as DbService
    participant H as HistoryService

    U->>E: 编写/选中 SQL，点「执行」(限制开关状态)
    E->>Q: POST /api/query/execute {connectionId, sql, unlimited}
    Q->>CS: getById(connectionId)
    CS->>CR: decrypt(passwordEnc)
    CS-->>Q: ConnectionRecord(明文密码仅内存)
    Q->>DB: execute(conn, sql, {unlimited})
    DB->>DB: 若 unlimited!=true 且为单行SELECT且无LIMIT → 追加 LIMIT 1000
    DB->>DB: 执行并计时
    DB-->>Q: QueryResult{columns,rows,rowCount,elapsedMs,truncated}
    Q->>H: add({connectionId, sql, status, ...})
    Q-->>E: {code:0, data:QueryResult}
    E-->>U: 结果表格 + 行数 + 耗时

%% ===== 时序图 3：AI 生成 SQL（仅建议，不自动执行） =====
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant A as AiPanel (前端)
    participant R as AiRoute
    participant CS as ConnectionService
    participant SC as SchemaService
    participant AI as AiService
    participant CR as CryptoService
    participant LLM as OpenAI兼容接口

    U->>A: 输入自然语言需求，点「发送」
    A->>R: POST /api/ai/generate {connectionId, prompt}
    R->>CS: getById(connectionId)
    CS-->>R: ConnectionRecord
    R->>SC: getDdlContext(conn)
    SC->>SC: 读 information_schema(表名/列名/类型/注释)
    SC-->>R: DDL 上下文文本(无数据行)
    R->>AI: generate(conn, prompt, ddl)
    AI->>CR: decrypt(apiKeyEnc)
    AI->>LLM: POST {baseUrl}/chat/completions {system:SQL专家+DDL, user:需求}
    LLM-->>AI: choices[0].message.content
    AI->>AI: 剥离 ```sql 围栏，仅保留 SQL
    AI-->>R: AiGenerateRes{sql, model}
    R-->>A: {code:0, data:AiGenerateRes}
    A-->>U: 展示生成 SQL + [回填编辑器][复制]
    Note over U,A: 用户点击「回填编辑器」→ 仅写入 SqlEditor，**不**触发执行(P0-5)
